cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CAROUSEL, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CAROUSEL: An Open-Source Platform for Personalized Scientific Literature Discovery and Research Intelligence"
abstract: >-
  CAROUSEL is an open-source scientific literature intelligence platform that
  continuously monitors scholarly publications, recommends relevant research
  with transparent and reproducible ranking, and detects how a research field
  is changing over time (Research Delta).
authors:
  - family-names: Lucaci
    given-names: Alexander
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aglucaci/Carousel"
url: "https://aglucaci.github.io/Carousel/"
keywords:
  - scientific literature
  - recommender systems
  - research intelligence
  - literature surveillance
  - reproducibility
